<p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;">
REAL-WORLD CONNECTION: AI Voice Cloning Scams
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
In recent years, scammers have used AI tools to clone people’s voices using only short audio clips from social media videos or online recordings.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
Some families received phone calls that sounded exactly like a friend or family member asking for money or help during an emergency.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;">
Stories like these highlight why context, privacy, and human judgment matter when deciding whether AI-generated information should be trusted.
</p>

</div>
